# #Reclamation Project - Minutemen faction

department-Minutemen = Minutemen
department-Minutemen-description = The Commonwealth Minutemen, a volunteer militia sworn to defend the settlements. Run out of the Castle.

job-name-minutemen-recruit = Minutemen Recruit
job-description-minutemen-recruit = Answer the call. Learn the ropes, follow your superiors, and help protect the settlements of the Commonwealth.

job-name-minutemen-private = Minutemen Private
job-description-minutemen-private = Serve as a Minutemen rifleman. Defend the settlements and follow the orders of your NCOs and officers.

job-name-minutemen-corporal = Minutemen Corporal
job-description-minutemen-corporal = Lead a small fireteam of Minutemen in the field and keep the junior ranks in line.

job-name-minutemen-sergeant = Minutemen Sergeant
job-description-minutemen-sergeant = The backbone of the Minutemen. Train recruits, lead squads, and carry out your officers' orders.

job-name-minutemen-lieutenant = Minutemen Lieutenant
job-description-minutemen-lieutenant = A junior officer of the Minutemen. Plan patrols, lead squads in the field, and report to your Captain.

job-name-minutemen-captain = Minutemen Captain
job-description-minutemen-captain = A senior officer of the Minutemen. Command the Castle garrison's day-to-day operations and keep the officers organised.

job-name-minutemen-commander = Minutemen Commander
job-description-minutemen-commander = The highest rank a Minuteman can earn. Run the Minutemen's operations in the General's name.

job-name-minutemen-colonel = Minutemen Colonel
job-description-minutemen-colonel = Admin-only. An in-character role for admins who need to come to the Castle and handle matters in person.

job-name-minutemen-general = Minutemen General
job-description-minutemen-general = The General of the Minutemen and the leader of the faction. The settlements look to you.

job-supervisors-minutemen-officers = your Minutemen NCOs and officers
job-supervisors-minutemen-general = the General of the Minutemen
job-supervisors-minutemen-commonwealth = the people of the Commonwealth

